# Curzon Dax's first ability (CR 603.2, 603.10a): Wrath of God destroys Curzon,
# Bot1's Storied Veteran (a Klingon) and Goblin Piker (a Warrior), and Bot2's
# Defense Force Aggressor (a Klingon Warrior) at once. The trigger looks back,
# so it sees the two creatures Bot1 controlled that died with Curzon, but not
# Curzon itself ("another") and not the opponent's Warrior ("you control").
# Two triggers therefore deal 1 to each opponent: Bot2 and Bot3 go to 18, and
# Bot1 stays at 20. Curzon's own dies trigger finds no creature in hand and
# resolves without putting anything onto the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Curzon Dax, Bound by Blood
Storied Veteran
Mox Jet
Goblin Piker
Wrath of God
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Defense Force Aggressor
Island x18

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

